      "predicate": "HAS_OMBUDSMAN_SUMMARY",
      "value": "Mr X complained on behalf of his mother Mrs Y, the Council failed to clearly set out and explain Mrs Y’s care charges and adjustments. The Council was at fault. It will recalculate Mrs Y’s care charges for early October 2022, apologise and pay Mr X a symbolic payment for the confusion and uncertainty caused by the backdated invoices and adjustments made. It will also provide evidence of the service improvements it has already put in place.",
